            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1614-1634",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          },
          {
            "content_hash": "sha256:7107388ec35b5364f1700a29c0e0dfc2bd142794ae6cdf623da6ad7112efc5c1",
            "record_id": "example:2608.14798v1-db635458e365-span-1669-1669",
            "record_type": "agtxiv.v3.source-span/0.0.0",
            "revision": 1
          }
        ],
        "statement": "N is completely positive and trace preserving; the maximally entangled state used for the Choi construction is normalized and |A|=|A'|."
      },
